WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:01.701
Hi, everyone. This is Sally.

2
00:00:01.701 --> 00:00:05.872
I'm originally from Long Island, New York,
and I'm currently a fourth year student

3
00:00:05.872 --> 00:00:09.509
here majoring in Business Administration
at the Tepper School

4
00:00:09.509 --> 00:00:12.512
with an additional major
in French and Francophone Studies.

5
00:00:12.512 --> 00:00:17.450
One of my favorite memories from living on
campus was actually a neighborhood event

6
00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:21.154
organized by CMU that I participated
in during my first year here.

7
00:00:21.154 --> 00:00:24.391
We went Apple Picking
in their local farm in the fall.

8
00:00:24.391 --> 00:00:28.261
It was solely covered by CMU,
which was really nice to begin with.

9
00:00:28.261 --> 00:00:31.498
But more importantly,
it was a super fun way to take a break

10
00:00:31.498 --> 00:00:32.766
from all the academics.

11
00:00:32.766 --> 00:00:35.869
I remember specifically
that I went with my roommates

12
00:00:35.869 --> 00:00:38.538
and a lot of other students
in my housing neighborhood.

13
00:00:38.538 --> 00:00:40.473
We all went together as a group,

14
00:00:40.473 --> 00:00:43.510
hopped on a school bus,
which made it a lot easier to get to know

15
00:00:43.510 --> 00:00:47.480
everyone in my residence hall outside of
just seeing them in the hallways.

16
00:00:47.514 --> 00:00:50.617
Now, thinking back to that,
it was a really fun experience.

17
00:00:50.617 --> 00:00:52.752
After we went that every morning,

18
00:00:52.752 --> 00:00:56.256
my roommates and I would
just grab an apple out of our refrigerator

19
00:00:56.256 --> 00:00:59.059
that we personally picked
and start our day. Just like that.

20
00:00:59.059 --> 00:01:01.895
I think experiences like this
are really what help to

21
00:01:01.895 --> 00:01:05.965
build a close knit community here
that we really emphasize at CMU.

